VAT,\ninvoicing, and payment compliance for you — and it's ",[211,216,217],{},"Europe-first",", operating under EU\njurisdiction.",[189,220,221,222,225,226,200,233,238,239,244],{},"This page is an honest, side-by-side look at how ",[193,223,224],{},"vatly-laravel"," stacks up against the\nCashier-style packages you might otherwise reach for —\n",[227,228,232],"a",{"href":229,"rel":230},"https://laravel.com/docs/12.x/billing",[231],"nofollow","Laravel Cashier (Stripe)",[227,234,237],{"href":235,"rel":236},"https://laravel.com/docs/12.x/cashier-paddle",[231],"Laravel Cashier (Paddle)",", and\n",[227,240,243],{"href":241,"rel":242},"https://github.com/lmsqueezy/laravel",[231],"Lemon Squeezy for Laravel"," — gaps included.",[246,247,248],"blockquote",{},[189,249,250,253,254,256],{},[211,251,252],{},"Already running one of these in an existing app?"," This page helps you choose. Once you\nhave, ",[227,255,172],{"href":173}," shows how to add Vatly\nnext to your current biller and migrate customers over gradually.",[258,259],"hr",{},[261,262,264],"h2",{"id":263},"at-a-glance","At a glance",[266,267,268,291],"table",{},[269,270,271],"thead",{},[272,273,274,277,280,283,286],"tr",{},[275,276],"th",{},[275,278,279],{},"Cashier (Stripe Billing)",[275,281,282],{},"Cashier (Paddle)",[275,284,285],{},"Lemon Squeezy",[275,287,288],{},[211,289,290],{},"Vatly",[292,293,294,320,345,365,394,417,454,478,503,520,536,554],"tbody",{},[272,295,296,300,305,310,315],{},[297,298,299],"td",{},"Composer package",[297,301,302],{},[193,303,304],{},"laravel/cashier",[297,306,307],{},[193,308,309],{},"laravel/cashier-paddle",[297,311,312],{},[193,313,314],{},"lemonsqueezy/laravel",[297,316,317],{},[193,318,319],{},"vatly/vatly-laravel",[272,321,322,325,330,335,340],{},[297,323,324],{},"Billable trait",[297,326,327],{},[193,328,329],{},"Laravel\\Cashier\\Billable",[297,331,332],{},[193,333,334],{},"Laravel\\Paddle\\Billable",[297,336,337],{},[193,338,339],{},"LemonSqueezy\\Laravel\\Billable",[297,341,342],{},[193,343,344],{},"Vatly\\Laravel\\Billable",[272,346,347,349,355,358,360],{},[297,348,213],{},[297,350,351,354],{},[211,352,353],{},"No"," — you are the seller",[297,356,357],{},"Yes",[297,359,357],{},[297,361,362],{},[211,363,364],{},"Yes (full)",[272,366,367,370,376,382,389],{},[297,368,369],{},"Entity / jurisdiction",[297,371,372,375],{},[206,373,374],{},"You"," (wherever you're registered)",[297,377,378,379],{},"Paddle, ",[211,380,381],{},"UK",[297,383,384,385,388],{},"Lemon Squeezy, ",[211,386,387],{},"US"," (Stripe-owned)",[297,390,391],{},[211,392,393],{},"EEA / EU jurisdiction",[272,395,396,399,408,411,413],{},[297,397,398],{},"Who remits VAT/sales tax",[297,400,401,403,404,407],{},[211,402,374],{}," (Stripe Tax only ",[206,405,406],{},"calculates",")",[297,409,410],{},"Provider",[297,412,410],{},[297,414,415],{},[211,416,410],{},[272,418,419,422,429,438,444],{},[297,420,421],{},"Customer stored as",[297,423,424,425,428],{},"columns on the billable model (",[193,426,427],{},"stripe_id",", …)",[297,430,431,434,435,407],{},[193,432,433],{},"customers"," table (",[193,436,437],{},"paddle_id",[297,439,440,443],{},[193,441,442],{},"lemon_squeezy_customers"," table",[297,445,446,449,450,453],{},[193,447,448],{},"vatly_id"," column on the billable model + ",[193,451,452],{},"vatly_*"," tables",[272,455,456,459,462,469,472],{},[297,457,458],{},"Checkout",[297,460,461],{},"Stripe Checkout (hosted) / Elements",[297,463,464,465,468],{},"Paddle.js ",[211,466,467],{},"overlay / inline"," (client-side JS)",[297,470,471],{},"Lemon.js overlay / hosted URL",[297,473,474,477],{},[211,475,476],{},"Vatly-hosted redirect"," (+ guest claim)",[272,479,480,483,488,493,498],{},[297,481,482],{},"Webhook route",[297,484,485],{},[193,486,487],{},"/stripe/webhook",[297,489,490],{},[193,491,492],{},"/paddle/webhook",[297,494,495],{},[193,496,497],{},"/lemon-squeezy/webhook",[297,499,500],{},[193,501,502],{},"/webhooks/vatly",[272,504,505,508,510,512,514],{},[297,506,507],{},"Coupons / promo codes",[297,509,357],{},[297,511,357],{},[297,513,357],{},[297,515,516,519],{},[211,517,518],{},"On the roadmap"," (workaround below)",[272,521,522,525,527,529,531],{},[297,523,524],{},"License keys",[297,526,353],{},[297,528,353],{},[297,530,357],{},[297,532,533,535],{},[211,534,518],{}," (rarely needed for SaaS)",[272,537,538,541,544,547,549],{},[297,539,540],{},"Refunds & chargebacks",[297,542,543],{},"wire it yourself",[297,545,546],{},"events",[297,548,546],{},[297,550,551],{},[211,552,553],{},"first-class models + events",[272,555,556,559,561,563,565],{},[297,557,558],{},"Trials, swap, grace/resume",[297,560,357],{},[297,562,357],{},[297,564,357],{},[297,566,567],{},[211,568,357],{},[189,570,571],{},"Two takeaways:",[573,574,575,594],"ol",{},[576,577,578,587,588,593],"li",{},[211,579,580,582,583,586],{},[193,581,304],{}," runs on classic Stripe Billing, where ",[206,584,585],{},"you're"," the seller of record"," and\nown VAT registration, filing and remittance. Stripe has a real MoR too\n(",[227,589,592],{"href":590,"rel":591},"https://stripe.com/managed-payments",[231],"Managed Payments","), and Cashier — actively maintained —\nwill likely support it before long. Being an MoR is table stakes now, not a Vatly-only edge.",[576,595,596,599],{},[211,597,598],{},"So the real difference between MoRs is jurisdiction."," Paddle is UK, Lemon Squeezy and Stripe\nare US, Vatly is EEA — your seller-of-record entity and customer data stay under EU law. That,\nnot the API, is the reason to choose one over another.",[258,601],{},[261,603,605],{"id":604},"the-developer-experience","The developer experience",[189,607,608,609,611],{},"For a greenfield app, Vatly is your only biller — so you use the plain ",[193,610,195],{}," trait, and\nthe code reads like Cashier:",[613,614,618],"pre",{"className":615,"code":616,"language":617,"meta":105,"style":105},"language-php shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","use Vatly\\Lara